sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as "Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Admin->>UI: Enter SKU, category, price and shelf life
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/products
    API->>App: Create product
    App->>+DB: Validate SKU/category and save Draft
    DB-->>-App: Draft product
    App-->>UI: Draft created
    Admin->>UI: Publish product
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/products/{id}/publish
    API->>App: Publish(id)
    App->>DB: Validate mandatory fields and current version
    alt Complete draft
        App->>DB: Set Published and snapshot price
        API-->>-UI: Published
    else Invalid draft
        API-->>-UI: Validation error
    end
    Note over UI,DB: Published product/price is immutable; change uses Inactive + new SKU or clone-to-Draft.


